<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Tambayan House - The crispiest, most flavorful fried chicken in town.">
    <title>Tambayan House | Fried Chicken</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS Styles */
        :root {
            /* Adjusted orange for better text contrast */
            --primary-orange: #d35400; 
            --light-bg: #fff9f5;
            --dark-text: #222222;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --focus-color: #005fcc;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--light-bg);
            color: var(--dark-text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Accessibility: Skip to Main Content Link */
        .skip-link {
            position: absolute;
            top: -40px;
            left: 0;
            background: var(--dark-text);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 8px;
            z-index: 2000;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: top 0.3s;
        }
        .skip-link:focus {
            top: 0;
        }

        /* Focus States for Keyboard Navigation */
        a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid var(--focus-color);
            outline-offset: 3px;
        }

        /* Header & Navigation */
        header {
            background-color: var(--white);
            padding: 15px 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .brand-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo-img {
            height: 50px;
            width: 50px;
            background-color: var(--primary-orange);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            /* In a real site, this would be an actual image */
        }

        .logo-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--dark-text);
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background-color: var(--primary-orange);
            color: var(--white);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: var(--white);
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            padding: 15px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 50px;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Section Layouts */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 60px 20px;
        }

        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--primary-orange);
            display: inline-block;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* Core Values */
        .values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .value-card {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border-top: 5px solid var(--primary-orange);
        }

        .value-card h3 {
            color: var(--primary-orange);
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        /* Products / Menu */
        #menu {
            background-color: #fcece3;
        }

        .product-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .product-card {
            background-color: var(--white);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .product-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background-color: #ddd; /* Placeholder background */
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .product-info {
            padding: 20px;
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .product-title {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: var(--primary-orange);
        }

        .product-desc {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .product-price {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--dark-text);
        }

        /* Footer / Contact */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--primary-orange);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }

        .footer-content {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .contact-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .contact-item {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .contact-item h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .contact-item p, .contact-item a {
            color: var(--white);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>

    <header>
        <a href="#" class="brand-container" aria-label="Tambayan House Home">
            <img src="/api/placeholder/50/50" alt="Tambayan House Logo" class="logo-img">
            <span class="logo-text">Tambayan House</span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Main Navigation">
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#about">About Us</a></li>
                <li><a href="#values">Core Values</a></li>
                <li><a href="#menu">Our Menu</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content">
        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
            <h1 id="hero-title">Welcome to Tambayan House</h1>
            <p>The crispiest, most flavorful fried chicken in town. A local favorite dedicated to bringing people together over great food.</p>
            <a href="#menu" class="btn">View Our Menu</a>
        </section>

        <section id="about" class="container grid-2">
            <div>
                <h2 class="section-title">Company Profile</h2>
                <p>At <strong>Tambayan House</strong>, we believe that great food brings people together. What started as a small kitchen experiment driven by a passion for spices has grown into a local community favorite. We are more than just a restaurant; we are a destination dedicated to serving the crispest, most flavorful fried chicken in town, creating a warm, inviting space for friends and families to connect.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h2 class="section-title">Why Choose Us?</h2>
                <p><strong>11 Secret Herbs and Spices:</strong> Our chicken is carefully marinated, giving you a unique, bold flavor profile that you won't find anywhere else.</p>
                <p><strong>Crispy & Juicy Promise:</strong> We use a specialized, proprietary cooking technique that locks in the natural juices while creating that perfect, golden-brown crunch you crave.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="values" class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Core Values</h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                    <p>To serve the highest-quality, most flavorful fried chicken, providing a welcoming atmosphere that brings joy to every gathering and exceeds customer expectations with every bite.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <h3>Our Vision</h3>
                    <p>To become the leading comfort food destination in the region, recognized for our uncompromising quality, innovative flavors, and deep community roots.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <h3>Our Goals</h3>
                    <p>1. Maintain strict quality control on all ingredients.<br>2. Deliver exceptional, friendly customer service daily.<br>3. Expand our menu to cater to diverse palates while staying true to our core flavors.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="menu">
            <div class="container">
                <h2 class="section-title">Recommended Menu</h2>
                <p>Explore our carefully crafted dishes. Real flavor, honest prices.</p>
                
                <div class="product-grid">
                    <div class="product-card">
                        <img src="/api/placeholder/400/200" alt="Plated Grilled Chicken Steak with side salad" class="product-img">
                        <div class="product-info">
                            <h3 class="product-title">Grilled Chicken Steak</h3>
                            <p class="product-desc">Juicy, tender chicken steak grilled to perfection, served with a side of fresh mixed vegetables and our signature sauce.</p>
                            <span class="product-price">₱ 250.00</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-card">
                        <img src="/api/placeholder/400/200" alt="Whole Roast Chicken Herb on a platter" class="product-img">
                        <div class="product-info">
                            <h3 class="product-title">Roast Chicken Herb</h3>
                            <p class="product-desc">A whole chicken slowly roasted with a blend of aromatic herbs, ensuring a savory, melt-in-your-mouth experience.</p>
                            <span class="product-price">₱ 380.00</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-card">
                        <img src="/api/placeholder/400/200" alt="Basket of Crispy Fried Chicken and french fries" class="product-img">
                        <div class="product-info">
                            <h3 class="product-title">Crispy Fried Chicken</h3>
                            <p class="product-desc">Our classic signature item. Marinated in 11 secret herbs and spices, fried to a perfect golden-brown crunch.</p>
                            <span class="product-price">₱ 180.00</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="product-card">
                        <img src="/api/placeholder/400/200" alt="Bowl of Chicken Fried Rice" class="product-img">
                        <div class="product-info">
                            <h3 class="product-title">Chicken Fried Rice</h3>
                            <p class="product-desc">Flavorful wok-tossed fried rice mixed with savory chicken chunks, egg, and fresh garden vegetables.</p>
                            <span class="product-price">₱ 120.00</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer id="contact">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <h2 style="font-size: 32px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid white; display: inline-block; padding-bottom: 5px;">Contact Us</h2>
            <p>We'd love to hear from you. Reach out to place an order or inquire about catering!</p>
            
            <div class="contact-grid">
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <h3>📞 Phone</h3>
                    <p>+63 912 345 6789<br>(032) 123-4567</p>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <h3>✉️ Email</h3>
                    <p><a href="mailto:dragonopaw@gmail.com">dragonopaw@gmail.com</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <h3>🌐 Website</h3>
                    <p><a href="http://www.FriedDragon.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.FriedDragon.com</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-item">
                    <h3>📍 Location</h3>
                    <p>North Pole</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
